<title>THAILAND: Phoenix Pulp 1996 net swings to loss.</title>
<headline>Phoenix Pulp 1996 net swings to loss.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for the year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				   Twelve months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht) Loss	 3.59	vs  Profit    8.03</p>
<p>    Net	  Loss     421.40	vs  Profit  972.92</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Phoenix Pulp and Paper Plc, a pulp and paper producer. The company said its loss in 1996 was a result of weaker pulp and paper prices. It also said it incurred a foreign exchange loss of 65.47 million baht in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
